<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-wasmcontainers – Start</title><link>https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/0.29/tags/start/</link><description>Recent content in Start on go-wasmcontainers</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/0.29/tags/start/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Getting started</title><link>https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/0.29/getting-started/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/0.29/getting-started/</guid><description>
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="in-your-browser"&gt;In your browser&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="in-your-browser"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#in-your-browser" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open &lt;a href="https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/playground/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/playground/&lt;/a&gt; and type
&lt;code&gt;wctr run --rm hello&lt;/code&gt;. Nothing to install, no server: see the
&lt;a href="https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/0.29/playground/"&gt;Playground&lt;/a&gt; page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="install"&gt;Install&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="install"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#install" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Go 1.27.3 or later, no cgo. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;wctr&lt;/code&gt; is a module of its own now, with &lt;code&gt;wctr build&lt;/code&gt;
and &lt;code&gt;wctr compose&lt;/code&gt; built in&lt;/strong&gt;, so there are two &lt;code&gt;go install&lt;/code&gt; commands, one per
module (one command naming both no longer works):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go install github.com/go-wasmcontainers/engine/cmd/wctr@v0.1.0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go install github.com/go-wasmcontainers/engine/cmd/wctrd@v0.29.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;cmd/wctr&lt;/code&gt; v0.1.0 requires engine v0.16.0, so the &lt;code&gt;wctr&lt;/code&gt; it installs carries that
version&amp;rsquo;s commands; the daemon (&lt;code&gt;wctrd&lt;/code&gt;, engine v0.29.1) serves everything else,
including &lt;code&gt;exec&lt;/code&gt; and published ports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shell completion for &lt;code&gt;wctr&lt;/code&gt; (bash, zsh, fish or PowerShell), for example in
zsh:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wctr completion zsh &amp;gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;${&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;fpath&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[1]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;/_wctr&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="a-session"&gt;A session&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="a-session"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#a-session" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the output of the engine&amp;rsquo;s acceptance test at v0.1.0
(&lt;code&gt;TestAcceptance&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;code&gt;cmd/wctrd&lt;/code&gt;), run against the real binaries in CI; nothing is edited. The
default socket, &lt;code&gt;/var/run/wctr.sock&lt;/code&gt;, needs write access to &lt;code&gt;/var/run&lt;/code&gt;, so the
session uses a socket in the home directory:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-console" data-lang="console"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;WCTR_HOST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;unix://&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$HOME&lt;/span&gt;/wctr.sock
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; wctrd -H &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$WCTR_HOST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;wctrd v0.1.0 listening on unix:///home/me/wctr.sock (data root /home/me/.local/share/wasmcontainers)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With an OCI image layout &lt;code&gt;./layout&lt;/code&gt; holding three images (&lt;code&gt;hello&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;greet&lt;/code&gt;,
&lt;code&gt;probe&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-console" data-lang="console"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; wctr pull oci:./layout:hello
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Pulling from oci:/home/me/layout:hello
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;f0beefb89ff1: Pulling fs layer
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;f0beefb89ff1: Pull complete
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Digest: sha256:da3eead2a4f462a53bebdee2f9dc5fcb94cc5a97ebe1680477f0ce0328ff67f0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Status: Downloaded newer image for hello:latest
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; wctr run --rm hello
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Hello from a WebAssembly container!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; wctr run --rm -e &lt;span class="nv"&gt;NAME&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;x greet
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;Hello, x!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; wctr run --name failing probe &lt;span class="nb"&gt;exit&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="m"&gt;42&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;bye
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;$?&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;42
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; wctr ps -a
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;CONTAINER ID IMAGE COMMAND CREATED STATUS PORTS NAMES
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;2105748c99ce probe &amp;#34;/bin/probe.wasm exi…&amp;#34; 1 second ago Exited (42) Less than a second ago failing
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; wctr logs failing
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;bye
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; wctr rm failing
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;failing
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; wctr images
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;REPOSITORY TAG IMAGE ID CREATED SIZE
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;greet latest 068beee4f451 12 hours ago 2.45MB
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;hello latest 85c424cd2beb 12 hours ago 735kB
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;probe latest ae7fb9d7cefb 12 hours ago 811kB
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Registries work the same way (&lt;code&gt;wctr pull localhost:5000/lab/hello:v1&lt;/code&gt;, or
Docker Hub names such as &lt;code&gt;user/app:tag&lt;/code&gt;); &lt;code&gt;wctr run&lt;/code&gt; pulls an image it does not
have. The full list of commands and flags is on the
&lt;a href="https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/0.29/commands/"&gt;Commands&lt;/a&gt; page; what v0.1.0 does not do is on
&lt;a href="https://go-wasmcontainers.github.io/docs/0.29/limitations/"&gt;Limitations&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>